{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24504","headline":"送唐州崔使君侍亲赴任 · 白居易","name":"送唐州崔使君侍亲赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连持使节历专城，独贺崔侯最庆荣。\n乌府一抛霜简去，朱轮四从板舆行。\n发时止许沙鸥送，到日方乘竹马迎。\n唯虑郡斋宾友少，数杯春酒共谁倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}